  "description": "A peppery and silky Portuguese dish featuring roasted peanuts, this stew is a perfect hangover cure, and its ayurvedic sattvic friendly ingredients make it a great option for a healthy meal. It is cooked in a salt block vessel to add a unique flavor.",
