  "instructions": [
    "Heat the salt block vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the roasted peanuts and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste, cumin, and cayenne pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the coconut milk and vegetable broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with some crusty bread."
